           class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    </figure>

    <div class="bg-sky-50 border-l-4 border-sky-600 p-6 mb-10 rounded-r-xl">
      <p class="font-semibold text-sky-900 mb-2">Quick answer</p>
      <p class="text-sky-900">
        IMM 5476 is the free IRCC form that appoints someone to act for you on an immigration or citizenship application. As of November 14, 2026 the current edition is 11-2025. To appoint a representative you complete Sections A, B and E; to cancel one, Sections A, C and E. If the person is paid in any way, they must be a CICC licensed consultant, a lawyer or student-at-law of a Canadian law society, or a Quebec notary. Upload the form with an online application, or send it later through the IRCC web form.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-2xl text-center">
